      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "rehydration; replenishing fluids",
      "explanation": "The act of replenishing water or fluids in the body or a system. Commonly used in health, sports, and medical contexts for drinking water or administering fluids."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
